  "consentTitle": "Data processing consent",
  "consentBody": "The app needs to process camera frames in order to compute your heart rate and related metrics.\n\nThe app does not upload your frames to any server and stores data only on this device, and only if you explicitly agree.\n\nImportant: this app is not a medical device. Values such as SpO2 are indicative and may not be immediately available or accurate. Do not use the app as a substitute for medical equipment — if you have concerns, seek professional medical advice.",
  "consentWhatItDoesTitle": "What the app does:",
  "consentBullet1": "- Processes camera frames for PPG analysis.",
  "consentBullet2": "- Stores summary results locally.",
  "consentBullet3": "- Does not send raw image data without your consent.",
